# Copy to tests/mac/.env (gitignored) to test on a real Mac before a push:
# `make mac-check`, and `make pr-check` whenever this file names one.
#
# PLEIADES_MAC is the Mac, as anything ssh accepts: user@host, user@ip, or a
# Host alias from ~/.ssh/config. The Mac needs Remote Login on, this
# machine's public key in its ~/.ssh/authorized_keys, and go on its PATH.
# A linked worktree with no tests/mac/.env of its own reads the main
# worktree's. Delete tests/mac/.env to stop testing on a Mac.
PLEIADES_MAC=you@192.168.1.50
